WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.175
The message is split into numbered packets.

2
00:00:03.826 --> 00:00:06.376
Four numbered packets set off.

3
00:00:11.214 --> 00:00:14.489
One is lost. The others arrive out of order.

4
00:00:16.827 --> 00:00:20.877
The missing packet is sent again, and the numbers fix the order.
